{"id":103,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"When they work together, Exeggutor’s three heads can put out powerful psychic energy. Cloudy days make this Pokémon sluggish."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"Each of Exeggutor’s three heads is thinking different thoughts. The three don’t seem to be very interested in one another."},{"games":["Let’s Go, Eevee!","Let’s Go, Pikachu!"],"text":"Its cries are very noisy. This is because each of the three heads thinks about whatever it likes."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"Each of its three heads has its own thoughts. When they want to go in different directions, Exeggutor becomes unable to move."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"It engages its enemies using psychic powers. Each of its three heads fires off psychokinetic energy, tripling its power."},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"When the time comes, one of its three heads falls off. Before long, the fallen head grows into an Exeggcute."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"Each of its heads has its own will. They use telepathy to discuss their plans before coming to a joint decision."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Omega Ruby","Sapphire","Ruby"],"text":"Exeggutor originally came from the tropics. Its heads steadily grow larger from exposure to strong sunlight. It is said that when the heads fall off, they group together to form Exeggcute."},{"games":["Y","White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"It is called “The Walking Jungle.” If a head grows too big, it falls off and becomes an Exeggcute."},{"games":["X","HeartGold","Gold"],"text":"Its three heads think independently. However, they are friendly and never appear to squabble."},{"games":["SoulSilver","Silver"],"text":"If a head drops off, it emits a telepathic call in search of others to form an EXEGGCUTE cluster."},{"games":["LeafGreen"],"text":"It is said that on rare occasions, one of its heads will drop off and continue on as an EXEGGCUTE."},{"games":["FireRed"],"text":"It is called “The Walking Tropical Rainforest.” Each of the nuts has a face and a will of its own."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"Originally from the tropics, EXEGGUTOR’s heads grow larger from exposure to strong sunlight. It is said that when the heads fall, they group to form an EXEGGCUTE."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Chlorophyll","hidden":false,"description":"Boosts the Pokémon's Speed stat in harsh sunlight."},{"name":"Harvest","hidden":true,"description":"May create another Berry after one is used."}],"eggGroups":["Grass"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"slow","habitat":"forest","color":"Yellow","shape":"Legs","evolution":{"id":102,"name":"Exeggcute","condition":null,"children":[{"id":103,"name":"Exeggutor","condition":"Use Leaf Stone or Use Leaf Stone, in Alola","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[0,23],[1,71],[1,72],[1,73],[1,76],[1,93],[1,95],[1,115],[1,202],[1,235],[1,253],[1,326],[1,331],[1,388],[1,402],[1,437],[1,452],[1,473]],"machine":[34,523,331,347,174,38,89,203,412,797,263,248,202,416,447,803,580,356,270,63,286,437,113,67,345,182,60,244,94,917,678,473,115,156,402,285,214,188,76,707,500,164,241,14,36,851,168,271,433,253,428],"egg":[],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"me55-129","name":"Alolan Exeggutor","set":"30th Celebration","date":"2026-09-16","rarity":"Illustration Rare","number":"129","artist":"AYUMI ODASHIMA","small":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me55-129/small","large":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me55-129/large"},{"id":"me55-2","name":"Alolan Exeggutor","set":"30th Celebration","date":"2026-09-16","rarity":"Common","number":"2","artist":"Oswaldo KATO","small":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me55-2/small","large":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me55-2/large"},{"id":"me2pt5-78","name":"Team Rocket's Exeggutor","set":"Ascended Heroes","date":"2026-01-30","rarity":"Rare","number":"78","artist":"Ryuta Fuse","small":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me2pt5-78/small","large":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me